PREAMBLE

The Project is published in the spirit of the Open Internet 4.0 movement. The
Licensor believes that digital tools must respect user sovereignty: devices
must work without continuous corporate permission, data must be portable, and
software must be auditable, repairable, and forkable.

The source is open for study, personal use, and community contribution.
Commercial exploitation of the Project without the Licensor's knowledge and
consent is not permitted. Building surveillance, lock-in, or remote-disablement
products on top of the Project is not permitted by anyone.

Full manifesto: https://own-net.com/

