     The following do NOT, by themselves, create a Derivative Work:
       (a) interacting with the Software solely through its unmodified public
           interfaces (network protocols, IPC, command-line interface, or
           published application programming interfaces);
       (b) communicating with the Software over a network or between separate
           operating-system processes;
       (c) linking to, or being linked by, the Software's unmodified public
           interfaces, whether statically or dynamically, where Your code is a
           separate and independent work that does not itself embody a
