       (d) bundling the Software with other independent works on a storage or
           distribution medium ("mere aggregation").

1.10 "Commercial Use" means any of the following:
       (a) use of the Software or a Derivative Work by, or on behalf of, a
           person or legal entity whose Annual Gross Revenue exceeds the
           Revenue Threshold; or
       (b) making the functionality of the Software or a Derivative Work
