HOW TO APPLY THIS LICENSE TO YOUR OWN PROJECT

  1. Copy this file into your project as LICENSE.
  2. Fill in every field in the LICENSE PARAMETERS block.
  3. Set the "Change Date" field to "None", or to a date on which this License
     converts to a stated Open Source license for that release; if you use a
     Change Date, add a "Change License" field naming the target license and a
     sentence stating the conversion. (This template does not itself convert.)
  4. Add a short header to each source file, or a NOTICE file, of the form:
        <Project>  Copyright (c) <year> <holder>
        Licensed under the OwnNet Source License 1.1. See LICENSE.
        Commercial use requires a separate agreement: <contact>

